# Claude Code session scratch (parse-check harnesses, isolated
# worktrees, per-project settings). Never belongs on origin, EXCEPT
# .claude/agents/ (shared recon + reviewer agents, tracked deliberately)
# and .claude/rig/ (the Desktop-Wave measurement rig — server + seed/auth
# stub + measurement harness. Tracked from DW-4 under the rig-efficiency
# law: a session LOADS the rig, it does not rebuild it. The hard-won facts
# live in its comments; rebuilding them costs a gate every time.)
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/rig/
